这就是它们连接到两端的做法。而且每个数据中心都可以拥有独立的互联网连接。
and that's how they connect to the two sides. and each one of the data centers can have a separate internet connection.

1362
02:14:36,112 --> 02:14:43,076
所以如果我们丢失了一个数据中心或其中一条连接，连接到这些点的 LAN 将会与这一个和那一个互通。
So if we lose one of the data centers or one of the connections, the LANs connected they will be interconnected to this one and to that one.

1363
