在这种情况下，我有交换机连接所有的设备。所以在一栋楼内部，我们没问题。
So in that case, and I have the switches connecting all the devices. So within a building, we are fine.

1375
02:15:54,640 --> 02:15:57,252
我们可以连接、共享、打印，所有功能都能正常使用。
We can connect and we can share and can print and everything.

