数据中心到互联网
the data center to the internet

1381
02:16:17,806 --> 02:16:27,332
并且让它们共用一个互联网连接，然后我们可以通过上行链路将它们连接起来。由于它们可以达到更高的速度并传输更远的距离，所以会使用光纤，
and have common internet connection for all of them, then we can connect them using uplinks. And this will be fiber optic because they can go higher speeds and longer distances,

1382
02:16:28,240 --> 02:16:31,332
在这种情况下不使用铜缆或 UTP 线。
not copper cables in that case, or UTP cables.

1383
