好的，这就是一个 CAN。
All right, so that's a CAN.

1384
02:16:33,422 --> 02:16:40,932
它是一个私有的高速网络，连接同一个园区或有限区域内的多个建筑，比如大学、医院或公司园区。
So it's a private high-speed network that links several buildings on one campus or a limited area, like a university, hospital, or company campus.

1385
02:16:41,294 --> 02:16:52,196
当然，还有城域网（MAN）等等，但目前这些就够了。我们已经学习了 LAN、无线局域网、WAN 和 CAN，这对于本课程的目的来说已经绰绰有余了。
Of course, there is MAN as well, Metropolitan Area Network and so on, but it is enough. We learned about LAN, Wireless LAN, WAN, and CAN, and that is more than enough for our purpose of this course.

