A wireless access point is a device that provides Wi-Fi signals, broadcasts Wi-Fi or broadcasts wireless LANs into a certain coverage area.

1393
02:17:42,879 --> 02:17:45,668
例如，在机场或学校里。
For example, at an airport or in a school.

1394
02:17:46,080 --> 02:17:50,820
如果区域很大，那么我可能需要多个 AP。一个就不够了。
And if the area is large, then I may need more than one map. One will not be enough.

1395
02:17:51,852 --> 02:17:53,280
它们长成这样的样子。
And this is how they look like.

1396
02:17:53,440 --> 02:18:02,240
也许当你走在公司、街道、学校或购物中心时，看看天花板，看看墙壁，你会发现类似这些的设备。
Maybe when you are walking down your company or street or school or shopping mall, look at the ceiling, look at the walls, you'll find devices similar to these.

1397
02:18:02,320 --> 02:18:03,972
这些就是无线接入点。
These are the wireless access points.

1398
