and 16 million hosts in each.

2415
03:42:55,438 --> 03:42:57,956
所以这是给极大型企业的。
So that's extremely large corporates.

2416
03:42:58,798 --> 03:43:02,404
举个例子：11.0.0.8。
An example, 11.0.0.08.

2417
03:43:03,342 --> 03:43:06,564
注意最左边的字节
So notice that the leftmost byte

2418
03:43:07,342 --> 03:43:09,636
从 1 开始，到 126 结束。
starts at 1 and ends at 126.

