2426
03:43:48,846 --> 03:43:52,708
举个例子：148.12.0.0 斜杠 16。
An example 148.12.0.0 slash 16.

2427
03:43:54,734 --> 03:43:58,148
C 类是给小型网络的。
Class C is for small networks.

2428
03:43:59,598 --> 03:44:02,340
所以 B 是中型网络，A 是大型网络。
So B is for medium networks. This is for large networks.

2429
03:44:03,534 --> 03:44:10,276
C 是小网络。默认子网掩码是斜杠 24。它从 192 开始，到 223 结束。
C is for small networks. The default subnet mask is slash 24. It starts from 192 and ends at 223.

2430
03:44:11,470 --> 03:44:12,420
最左边的字节。
The leftmost byte.

2431
03:44:13,102 --> 03:44:19,056
它包含超过 200 万个网络，很多网络，但每一个网络只有 256 个
It has 2 million plus networks, a lot of networks, but each one of them has only 256

2432
