2434
03:44:27,470 --> 03:44:27,972
没关系。
That's fine.

2435
03:44:28,334 --> 03:44:32,580
举个例子：196.12.108.024。
An example is 196.12.108.024.

2436
03:44:32,976 --> 03:44:40,868
根据最左边字节的数值，你可以判断出 IP 地址属于 A 类、B 类还是 C 类。
So IP address classes, by the look of the leftmost byte, you can tell whether that's a class A or a class B or a class C.

2437
03:44:41,678 --> 03:44:44,708
如果范围是 1 到 126，那肯定是 A 类。
So if it is from 1 to 126, that's a class A, definitely.

2438
03:44:45,262 --> 03:44:51,140
128 到 191 是 B 类，而 192 到 223 肯定是 C 类。
128 to 191, that's a B, and 192 to 223, that is a C for sure.

2439
