将一个 IP 地址块、一个 IP 地址范围划分为多个子网，或者叫成多个段、多个区块。
break an IP address block, an IP address range, into multiple subnets, we call it, or multiple segments, multiple chunks.

2443
03:45:19,918 --> 03:45:28,100
为什么要这样做？因为假设我有一栋校园建筑，并且有一大块 IP 地址，也就是一个大的地址块。
Why do we do this? We do it because if I have, let's say I have a campus building and I have a one big chunk of IP addresses, one block.

2444
03:45:29,056 --> 03:45:36,292
现在我需要在每栋楼里建立独立的局域网，然后把它们连接到数据中心，例如这样。
And now I need to build separate lands in each one of the buildings, and then I will connect them to the data center, for example.

2445
03:45:37,390 --> 03:45:47,936
那我该怎么做？我只有一个范围，而且不建议在很多建筑中使用相同的范围，因为这涉及很多复杂的底层技术问题，目前不需要深入探讨。
So how can I do this? I have only one range, and I cannot, it's not recommended to use the same range across a lot of buildings because it has a lot of technical implications way over our heads now,

2446
03:45:48,016 --> 03:45:58,340
我们不必去深究为什么要避免这样做。但建议将它分割或分配到多个子网中，然后在每栋楼里各用一个。
and we shouldn't get into the details why you should avoid that. But it's recommended that you segment or distribute that into multiple subnets and then use one in each building.

2447
03:45:58,798 --> 03:46:02,692
我再举个例子。假设是一家公司，它有
I'll give you another example. Let's say it's a corporate and it has

2448
03:46:03,776 --> 03:46:07,588
在全美 50 个州中的每一个都有一个办公室，
one office in each one of the 50 states in the United States,

2449
03:46:08,334 --> 03:46:11,620
而总部可能设在印度，例如这样。
and the headquarters is, let's say, in India, for example.

2450
03:46:12,238 --> 03:46:18,916
现在他们需要把这些连接起来。由于跨度很大，我们之前说过，如果不在附近，就必须使用广域网。
And now they need to connect this. So they have to go across one. We said if it's not in a close vicinity, it has to be a wide area network.

2451
03:46:19,374 --> 03:46:20,804
我们之前讨论过这个。
And we talked about that before.

2452
03:46:21,486 --> 03:46:22,436
在这种情况下，
So in that case,

2453
03:46:23,374 --> 03:46:31,216
如果你想拆分这一个大的范围，你必须把它拆开，否则你就无法使用它。
if you want to break it down, the one big range, you will have, you must break it down because otherwise you cannot use the one.

2454
03:46:33,056 --> 03:46:42,084
正确的做法是不去拆分，而是为每一个办公室隔离出一个 IP 地址块。它们不能共用同一个地址段，它们没法挤在一起。
The right way without breaking that down and isolating a block of IP addresses for each one of these offices. They cannot be in one office, they can't live in one office.

2455
03:46:42,496 --> 03:46:42,852
就是这样。
Period.

2456
03:46:43,822 --> 03:46:45,412
所以它们必须是
So they have to be

2457
03:46:46,126 --> 03:46:53,348
不同的或独立的 IP 地址范围，即从你拥有的那个大块中切分出较小的片段。
different or separate IP address ranges, smaller ones, chunks from the big block that you have.

2458
03:46:53,838 --> 03:46:55,376
这就是所谓的子网划分。
And that is called subnetting.

2459
03:46:55,456 --> 03:47:05,092
这就是我们要讨论子网划分的原因，但我们会用简单的方法来操作，不涉及复杂的数学计算，也不会用大量的二进制数把你们搞糊涂。
So that is why we are going to discuss subnetting, but we will start doing it the easy way without a lot of math and without confusing you with a lot of binaries and all that stuff.

2460
