如果你已经理解了前面的内容并且掌握得很好，那么你可以使用这种简便方法，直接开始实操。
If you have understood everything before this and you are good with that, then you can use the easy way and you are good to go.

2461
03:47:12,942 --> 03:47:18,980
如果你想了解更多细节，或者你计划进入工程领域
If you want to know more details, or if you are planning to be in the engineering side where you are going

2462
03:47:19,918 --> 03:47:28,896
去处理大量的故障排除，并且希望减少对计算器和在线工具的依赖，那么你可以学习接下来的内容
to do a lot of troubleshooting, and you want to minimize your dependence on calculators and online tools, then you can learn the details

2463
03:47:29,056 --> 03:47:31,972
这些细节将紧随其后。但现在我们用简单的方法来学。
which will follow this one. But now it's the easy way.

2464
03:47:32,494 --> 03:47:42,084
所以这是给那些想要简单方法、快速搞定事情的人准备的，但希望他们也能理解自己看到并得到的内容。
So this is for the people who want the easy stuff, the easy way, the faster way to do things, but hopefully also they understand what they will see and what they will get.

2465
03:47:42,176 --> 03:47:43,296
知道这一点非常重要。
This is very important to know.

2466
03:47:43,470 --> 03:47:46,084
好了，让我们来看看什么是子网划分。
Alright, so let's see what subnetting is.

2467
03:47:47,086 --> 03:47:54,884
子网划分允许我们把一个 IP 地址块分成更小的块，用于不同的网络。
Subnetting allows us to take one IP address block and then divide it into smaller blocks to be used on different networks.

2468
03:47:56,270 --> 03:48:05,892
把子网划分一个 IP 地址范围想象成切披萨。就像你有一块披萨，假设是个小披萨，你想把它切成四块。
Think of submitting an IP address range as slicing a pizza. Exactly when you have a pizza and you will have, let's say it's a small pizza and you would like to cut it into four slices.

2469
03:48:06,382 --> 03:48:15,876
这就是子网划分。这个 IP 地址范围就是整块披萨，而每一块切开的部分就叫作一个子网。
So that's exactly the subnetting. So this will be the block IP address range, the actual pizza, and then the slices, each one of them is being is going to be called a subnet.

2470
03:48:16,622 --> 03:48:22,736
当我们进行子网划分时，我们没有像切披萨那样随意决定怎么切的自由。
When we do subnetting, we don't have the liberty to decide how to cut it as we do with the pizza.

2471
03:48:22,816 --> 03:48:30,116
例如，在切披萨时，你可以决定切成六块、三块或者十二块。
For example, with the pizza, you may decide to cut it into six pieces or three pieces or twelve pieces.

2472
03:48:30,542 --> 03:48:32,336
但在子网划分中，你不能随心所欲。
In subnetting, you can do that.

2473
03:48:32,416 --> 03:48:34,276
你只能把它分成两个
You either divide it into two

2474
03:48:35,630 --> 03:48:36,548
或者四个
or four

2475
03:48:37,358 --> 03:48:38,244
或者八个
or eight

2476
03:48:38,958 --> 03:48:42,940
或者 16、32 或 64。
or 16 or 32 or 64.

2477
03:48:43,502 --> 03:48:46,416
这些数字看起来熟悉吗？
Does this seem familiar to you?

2478
03:48:46,894 --> 03:48:47,268
是的。
Yes.

2479
03:48:47,566 --> 03:48:50,308
这些是二进制的权重。
These are the weights of the binaries.

2480
03:48:50,734 --> 03:48:55,332
所以要么是两个，要么是四个，或者八个，或者 16、32 或 64。如果我只需要五个呢？
So it's either two or four or eight or 16 or 32 or 64. What if I need five only?

2481
03:48:55,662 --> 03:48:59,140
那你得选八个，然后留三个作为备用。
Then you have to go for eight and then you keep three as spear.

2482
03:48:59,758 --> 03:49:00,816
如果我需要十二个呢？
What if I need twelve?

2483
03:49:00,942 --> 03:49:04,700
那你得选 16 个，然后留四个作为备用。
Then you have to go for 16 and you keep four as spare

2484
03:49:04,700 --> 03:49:06,980
但如果你想要 20 个呢？
but if you want 20?

2485
03:49:07,310 --> 03:49:08,900
那你就要选 32 个。
Then you go for 32.

2486
03:49:09,262 --> 03:49:14,660
所以你按 32 分割，然后使用其中的 20 个，剩下的 12 个就是备用的。
So you divide it by 32, and then you will use 20, and then 12 are going to be spear.

2487
03:49:15,150 --> 03:49:23,940
这一点非常重要。你不能把 IP 地址块分成 3、5、7、11 或 9 等数量。
So this is very important to remember. You cannot divide an IP address block by 3 or by 5 or by 7 or by 11 or by 9.

2488
03:49:24,974 --> 03:49:28,736
给定一个需要划分的 IP 地址范围，我们需要知道什么？
Given an IP address range to subnet, we need to know. What do we need to know?

2489
03:49:28,896 --> 03:49:34,628
我们需要知道需要多少个子网，以及每个子网需要多少台主机。
We need to know how many subnets are needed and how many hosts are needed per subnet.

2490
03:49:35,502 --> 03:49:43,588
所以如果你被给了一个 IP 地址块，并且面临这样一个场景：美国 50 个州有 50 个办公室，
So if you are given an IP address block and you are given the scenario of the 50 offices in the 50 states in the USA,

2491
03:49:44,430 --> 03:49:52,484
并且你被告知需要将那个大块 IP 地址拆分，分成足够多的子网，供每个办公室使用。
and you are told that we need to break it down, that big block, into enough subnets that we can use in each one of these offices.

2492
03:49:53,056 --> 03:49:59,684
你最先要问的问题是：每个子网需要多少个主机？
The very first question that you would want to ask is how many hosts do you need per subnet?

2493
03:50:00,366 --> 03:50:03,300
也就是说，在每个办公室里，有多少台机器要连接到网络？
So in each office, how many machines are going to connect to the network?

2494
03:50:04,142 --> 03:50:08,900
如果他们有 50 台，那就按 64 来规划。或者干脆按 128 来。
If they are 50, then go for 64. or maybe go for 128.

2495
03:50:09,326 --> 03:50:18,980
所以你需要预留更多数量的 IP 地址，如果只有 64 个需求，就不要只给 64 个，因为万一明天又增加了一名新员工呢？
So you need to go for a higher number of IP addresses, not exactly 64 if they are 64, because what if a new employee is added tomorrow?

2496
03:50:19,566 --> 03:50:29,380
所以你总是要按照比实际需求稍微大一点的规模来设计。或者你可以问：有多少用户要连接，有多少设备要连接，也就是需要多少个主机？
So you always need to design for a little bit bigger than the requirements. Or maybe you can ask okay, how many users are going to connect, how many devices are going to connect, how many hosts?

2497
03:50:30,958 --> 03:50:39,908
如果对方告诉你是 64 个，那么接下来的问题就是：你们预计每年的增长率，或者每两三年的增长率是多少？
If you are told 64, then you can have a subsequent question is what is your anticipated growth rate per year or every couple of years?

2498
03:50:40,334 --> 03:50:47,332
是 10%、20% 还是 30%？这将帮助你决定子网该定多大的规模。
Is it going to be 10%, 20%, 30%? And that will help you decide what size you are going to make the subnet.

2499
03:50:48,046 --> 03:50:49,248
所以这一点非常重要。
So this is very important.

2500
03:50:49,582 --> 03:50:51,204
第二个问题是：需要多少个子网？
The second question is how many subnets?

2501
03:50:51,488 --> 03:50:55,204
我们在美国有 50 个办公室，分布在各个州。
So we have 50 offices in the United States in each one of the states.

2502
03:50:55,598 --> 03:51:00,036
有没有可能从这些办公室再开设分支机构？
Is there a chance you are going to open satellite offices from these offices?

2503
03:51:00,846 --> 03:51:05,956
如果答案是肯定的，那么你预计每 1 年、2 年、5 年或 10 年分别会增加多少个？
If the answer is yes, how many do you anticipate per year, per two, per five, per 10 years?

2504
03:51:06,478 --> 03:51:10,528
如果他们知道答案，那么你也需要设计得不仅仅是 50 个子网。
If they know the answer, then you need also to design not 50 subnets.

2505
03:51:10,688 --> 03:51:17,888
现在我会选择规划 128 个或 256 个子网。这样我就有足够的空间来扩展和增长了。
Now I will go for 128 subnets or maybe 256 subnets. So I will have a room to scale, to grow.

2506
03:51:18,158 --> 03:51:21,124
我不需要设计好后立刻就开始使用。
I don't need to design it and then start using it.

2507
03:51:21,390 --> 03:51:30,596
因为一年以后，我可能会说：哎呀，我没考虑到这一点。这样我们就得推倒重来，重新分配所有地址，那简直是噩梦。
And one year down the road, I would say, oops, okay, I didn't account for that. So now we have to redo everything and re-address everything, which will be a nightmare.

2508
03:51:31,054 --> 03:51:32,208
好的，所以这一点非常重要。
Okay, so this is very important.

2509
03:51:32,526 --> 03:51:36,048
这两个问题：需要多少个子网，以及每个子网有多少用户？
The two questions: how many subnets and how many users per subnet?

2510
03:51:36,128 --> 03:51:44,484
第三个问题是，这个问题能体现出你是否真正懂行：主机和子网的增长率分别是多少？
And the third question that will be and will show that you understand what you are doing is what is the growth rate for hosts and for subnets as

2511
03:51:45,294 --> 03:51:51,108
好，让我们看看如何处理一个 IP 地址范围并将其拆分，我们用最简单的方法来做。
well. So let's look at how we can have an IP address range and break it down, and we'll do it the easy way.

