04:32:07,758 --> 04:32:08,644
这就是它的运作原理。
And that's how it works.

3048
04:32:11,278 --> 04:32:19,504
好的，所以最后，给定的 IP 范围划分为四个子网后，生成的子网将是 slash /26，比原来的长两个位。
Okay, so at the end, the given IP range into four subnets, the resulting subnets will be slash /26, which is two bits longer than the original one.

3049
04:32:19,584 --> 04:32:25,252
也就是说我们从主机字段中借用了两个位来创建这四个子网。
So we have borrowed two bits from the host field in order to create the four subnets.

3050
04:32:27,758 --> 04:32:34,148
而每个新子网将只有六个主机位，这意味着只有 64 个 IP 地址。
And each new subnet will only have six host bits, which means 64 IP addresses only.

3051
04:32:34,510 --> 04:32:37,092
而原来的有 256 个。
Whereas the original one had 256.

3052
04:32:37,344 --> 04:32:46,020
有一个金科玉律，请记住它，刻在你的脑子里：一旦你对 IP 地址范围进行子网划分，
One golden rule, please stick that, engrave it in your brain, is once you subnet an IP address range,

3053
04:32:46,544 --> 04:32:51,620
你可以按自己的意愿使用这些，但你不能再使用这个了。
you can use these as you wish, but you cannot use this anymore.

3054
04:32:53,710 --> 04:32:54,884
这里有一个规则
And here's a rule

3055
04:32:55,566 --> 04:32:56,932
来总结我们讨论的内容。
to summarize what we discussed.

3056
04:32:57,200 --> 04:32:59,140
如果你从 slash /24 开始，
If you started from slash /24,

3057
04:32:59,822 --> 04:33:05,598
并且如果你只需要一个子网，那就不要进行子网划分。如果你需要两个子网，你就必须借用一个位。
and if you need one subnet, then don't don't do subnetting. If you need two subnets, then you have to borrow one bit.

3058
04:33:05,680 --> 04:33:08,612
那么生成的子网掩码将是 slash 25。
So the resulting subnet mask is going to be slash 25.

3059
04:33:09,358 --> 04:33:11,108
这将给你提供两个子网，
That will give you two subnets,

3060
04:33:11,840 --> 04:33:16,706
并且它会让你获得比 slash 24 提供的 8 个主机位更少的位数。
and it will leave you instead of slash 24 gives you 8 bits for the host.

3061
04:33:16,880 --> 04:33:19,556
这会让你剩下 7 个，因为你已经借用了 1 个。
This will leave you with 7 because you have already borrowed one.

3062
04:33:20,492 --> 04:33:29,284
这样每个生成的子网将有 128 个主机，其中可用的将是 126 个。
And that will leave you with a total of 128 hosts in each resulting subnet, and the usable ones will be 126.

3063
04:33:30,254 --> 04:33:36,228
请注意，原本你有 256 个，可用的是 254 个。
So please notice the original one you had 256 and the usable were 254.

3064
04:33:37,038 --> 04:33:40,484
现在你有两个子网，每个都有 128 个。
Here you have two subnets, each one of them has 128.

3065
04:33:41,518 --> 04:33:48,132
每个子网中可用的是 126 个。所以你在第一个子网浪费了两个，在第二个子网又浪费了两个。
The usable in each one of them is 126. So you waste two in the first subnet and you waste another two in the second subnet.

3066
04:33:48,558 --> 04:33:53,252
所以总的可用的主机不再是 254 个，而是 252 个。
So the total usable hosts are not going to be 254, they are going to be 252.

3067
04:33:54,094 --> 04:34:01,919
所以子网划分会浪费原始子网中的一些主机，但我们必须这样做，因为这是……
So subnetting wastes some hosts in the original subnet, but we have to do it because that is best practices for

3068
04:34:01,919 --> 04:34:08,612
构建基础设施、网络、不同区域、不同办公室以及不同广域网链路等时的最佳实践。
building infrastructures and networks and different lands and different offices and different wide area network links and so on.

3069
04:34:09,133 --> 04:34:13,026
如果你想划分成三个或四个子网，你必须借用两个位。
If you want to subnet to three or four subnets, you have to borrow two bits.

3070
04:34:13,838 --> 04:34:18,562
如果你想划分为五个、六、七甚至八个子网，那么你就得借用三个位。
If you want to subnet five, six, seven, or eight up to eight, then you have to borrow three bits.

3071
04:34:19,022 --> 04:34:22,500
而且每个子网的子网掩码都会变长。
And the subnet mask is going to be longer in each one of them.

3072
04:34:22,830 --> 04:34:30,820
这意味着剩余的主机位会减少，总主机数和可用主机数也会相应减少。
And that means the remaining host bits are going to be lesser, and the total number of hosts and the usable ones are going to be lesser as well.

3073
04:34:31,116 --> 04:34:34,596
所以正如你在这里看到的，你创建的子网越多……
So the more subnets you make, as you notice here,

3074
04:34:35,502 --> 04:34:39,330
例如，我这里有更多的子网，它是 /30。
for example, I have more subnets and it's /30.

3075
04:34:40,078 --> 04:34:42,276
它只有两个可用的 IP 地址。
It only has two usable IP addresses.

3076
04:34:42,862 --> 04:34:45,840
所以子网越多，每个子网中的主机就越少。
So the more subnets, the lesser hosts per subnet.

3077
04:34:46,000 --> 04:34:48,320
所以你必须思考这些问题：每个子网需要多少个主机？
So you have to ask the questions how many hosts per subnet?

3078
04:34:48,558 --> 04:34:53,680
你需要多少个子网？然后你可以评估一下分配给你的区块是否足够。
How many subnets do you need? And then you can assess and see if the block given to you is enough or not.

3079
04:34:53,868 --> 04:34:56,160
好了，希望这部分讲清楚了。
All right, Hopefully that was clear.

3080
04:34:57,806 --> 04:35:07,598
现在让我们来涵盖并识别公网 IP 地址。我们将讨论公网 IP 地址和私有 IP 地址，并区分它们之间的区别。
Now let's cover and identify the public IP addresses. We're going to talk about public IP addresses and then private IP addresses, and we're going to distinguish between them.

3081
04:35:07,758 --> 04:35:09,092
这非常重要，必须理解清楚。
Very important to understand.

3082
04:35:09,998 --> 04:35:14,850
那么什么是公网 IP 地址？公网 IP 地址是可以通过互联网访问的 IP 地址。
So what's a public IP address? A public IP address is an IP address that can be accessed over the internet.

3083
04:35:15,694 --> 04:35:19,840
你是说有些 IP 地址无法通过互联网访问吗？
Are you saying that there are IP addresses that cannot be accessed over the internet?

3084
04:35:20,160 --> 04:35:22,402
是的，这些就是私有 IP 地址。
Yes, and these are the private IP addresses.

3085
04:35:22,894 --> 04:35:23,651
在你的家里，
In your home,

3086
04:35:24,640 --> 04:35:26,660
在你的网络内部，
internally inside your network,

3087
04:35:27,662 --> 04:35:29,284
你会拥有私有 IP 地址。
you will have private IP addresses.

3088
04:35:30,382 --> 04:35:35,330
所以互联网无法直接进入你的机器。
So the internet cannot get directly into your machines.

3089
04:35:35,630 --> 04:35:36,258
它们进不来。
They cannot.

3090
04:35:37,166 --> 04:35:39,972
它们必须通过一个公网 IP 地址，
They have to go through a public IP address,

3091
04:35:41,966 --> 04:35:44,080
这就是它们连接到你的方式。
and that will be how they get to you.

3092
04:35:44,238 --> 04:35:56,356
然后这个路由器需要通过一些技术手段来转发流量。所以如果你在浏览器里输入 CNN.com，当你输入 CNN.com 时，你使用的是私有IP地址。
And then this router needs to do some magic to send you the traffic. So if you go on your browser and then you type CNN.com, when you type CNN.com, you are using a private IP address.

3093
04:35:56,652 --> 04:35:57,924
我们接下来要讲到这一点。
We're going to talk about this next.

3094
04:35:58,669 --> 04:36:04,720
路由器会在将请求发送到互联网之前，将其转换为公网IP地址。
And the router is going to convert that into a public IP address before sending that out to the internet.

3095
04:36:05,040 --> 04:36:11,680
就像是在掩盖不同的身份，告诉互联网：嘿，互联网，我在网上有明确的标识。
As if it is masking a different identity, telling the internet, hey internet, I am defined on the internet.

3096
04:36:12,080 --> 04:36:16,644
我有一个经过互联网认可的IP地址，也就是公网IP地址。
I have an internet approved IP address, a public IP address.

3097
04:36:17,006 --> 04:36:20,836
如果你想把响应传回给我，请使用这个IP地址。
And if you want to come back to me with the response, please use this IP address.

3098
04:36:22,414 --> 04:36:29,284
任何想要直接与互联网通信的设备或网络都必须使用公网IP地址。
Any device or network that wants to communicate directly with the internet must use a public IP address.

3099
04:36:29,520 --> 04:36:34,052
即使是你的家用路由器，是的，你的家用路由器确实有一个公网IP地址。
Even if it is your home router, yes, your home router does have a public IP address.

3100
04:36:34,606 --> 04:36:37,572
你办公室或公司的路由器也是一样的道理。
And same thing the router at your office or your company.

3101
04:36:37,838 --> 04:36:46,402
同样，当你去机场并连接到机场的无线局域网时，机场在互联网上必须拥有公网IP地址。
And the same thing when you go to an airport and you connect to the wireless LAN at the airport, then the airport must have public IP address on the internet.

3102
04:36:47,437 --> 04:36:55,396
反过来同样适用，这意味着如果我需要访问互联网上的 Amazon.com，Amazon.com 必须有一个公网IP地址。
If we reciprocate, that means if I need to get into Amazon.com on the internet, Amazon.com must have a public IP address.

3103
04:36:55,536 --> 04:36:56,484
是的，没错。
Yes, that's correct.

3104
04:36:57,038 --> 04:37:05,604
如果我想进入 CNN.com，或者 BritishTelecom.com，任何在互联网上可用的实体都必须拥有公网IP地址。
If I want to get into CNN.com, into BritishTelecom.com, anything that is available on the internet, that entity must have a public IP address.

3105
04:37:06,478 --> 04:37:07,856
那么什么是公网IP地址呢？
So what's the public IP address?

3106
04:37:08,016 --> 04:37:09,604
想想邮政系统。
Think about the postal system.

3107
04:37:10,414 --> 04:37:15,455
如果你没有在邮政系统中注册的地址，那就意味着没人能找到你。
If you don't have an address registered on the postal system, that means nobody can get to you.

3108
04:37:15,616 --> 04:37:24,836
如果你住在丛林中心，那里没有地址，没有街道，邮政系统也不会派送邮件到你的位置，那意味着你处于离网状态。
If you are living in the middle of the jungle and there is no address and there are no streets and post doesn't deliver into your location, that means you are off the grid.

3109
04:37:25,294 --> 04:37:26,402
没人知道你的存在。
Nobody knows about you.

3110
04:37:26,736 --> 04:37:31,556
为了能够发送和接收邮件，你必须有一个地址。
You must have an address in order to be able to send and receive mail.

3111
04:37:32,492 --> 04:37:41,455
在网络中的类比是：如果你想出现在互联网上，并且能被识别、被定位，能够发送和接收信息，你就必须拥有公网IP地址。
The analogy in the networking is if you would like to be on the internet and known and addressable on the internet, you can send and receive, you must have a public IP address.

3112
04:37:41,536 --> 04:37:42,532
这个地址不一定是你本人。
It doesn't have to be you.

3113
04:37:42,990 --> 04:37:45,936
但你所在的地点必须连接到互联网。
But the place where you are in must be connected to the internet.

3114
04:37:46,446 --> 04:37:48,452
你会从哪里获得它？在你的家里。
Where will you get that? At your home.

3115
04:37:48,814 --> 04:37:56,896
为你提供互联网连接的那家公司、服务提供商或电信公司会为你的路由器
The one company or service provider or telecom company that is providing you the internet connection will provide your router

3116
04:37:57,056 --> 04:37:57,955
分配一个公网IP地址。
with a public IP address.

3117
04:37:58,796 --> 04:38:01,220
这就是它的运作原理，没有任何例外。
So that's how it works, and there is no deviation from this.

3118
04:38:03,374 --> 04:38:13,220
公网IP地址在互联网上是可见的。所以除非你采取一些安全措施来拦截进入的流量，否则任何在线的人都能联系到它。
Public IP addresses, they are visible on the internet. So anyone online on the internet can reach it unless you put some security measures to block incoming traffic.

3119
04:38:14,286 --> 04:38:22,654
在全球互联网上，没有任何两个人和两户人家或两个实体会共用同一个IP地址。
There is no two persons or two homes or two entities globally on the internet that would be using the same IP address.

3120
04:38:22,736 --> 04:38:24,132
So it is 全球唯一.
So it is globally unique.

3121
04:38:25,166 --> 04:38:28,452
所以全球任何地方都不会有两个相同的公网IP。
So no two public IPs are the same anywhere in the globe.

3122
04:38:29,486 --> 04:38:33,124
它用于通信、网站、服务器和电子邮件。
And it is used for communication, for websites, for servers, for emails.

3123
04:38:33,455 --> 04:38:41,187
你在互联网上使用的电脑、笔记本或iPhone，都需要公网IP地址。
All your computer use on the internet or laptop or iPhone use on the internet needs public IP addresses.

3124
04:38:41,741 --> 04:38:42,883
而且它是可路由的。
And it is routable.

3125
04:38:43,056 --> 04:38:53,860
无论你身在何处，只要你有唯一的公网IP地址，别人就能找到你，也能把你的流量发送到互联网上的任何地方。
The internet, wherever you are, as long as you have a unique public IP address, they will be able to get to you and they will be able to send your traffic wherever you want to send it on the internet.

3126
04:38:57,166 --> 04:38:59,491
这些IP地址并不是随机分配的。
The IP addresses. Now it's not random.

3127
04:38:59,724 --> 04:39:09,056
正如我所说的，服务提供商、电信公司和政府是拥有并控制这些IP地址块的机构，
What you are telling me is the service provider, the telco companies, the governments are the ones that have the blocks of IP addresses and they are in control,

3128
04:39:09,216 --> 04:39:10,562
否则，情况就会变得一团糟。
otherwise, it's going to be a mess.

3129
04:39:10,926 --> 04:39:18,692
因此，IP地址必须由官方机构在全球范围内分配和管理，这就是所谓的IP地址层级结构。
So IP addresses must be assigned and managed globally by official organizations, and this is called the IP address hierarchy.

3130
04:39:19,116 --> 04:39:23,460
这些组织分布在不同的洲和不同的国家中。
And these are existing in the different continents and in different countries as well.

3131
04:39:23,950 --> 04:39:30,082
所以IP地址必须是唯一的。否则，如果两个实体拥有相同的IP，互联网就不知道该把数据发到哪里。
So IP address must be unique. Otherwise, if two entities had the same IP, the internet wouldn't know where to send the data.

3132
04:39:31,950 --> 04:39:33,696
这就是层级结构的结构。
And this is how the hierarchy looks like.

3133
04:39:33,868 --> 04:39:46,564
首先是IANA，然后在非洲、欧洲、亚太地区、拉丁美洲，接着是资源分配层级，然后是服务提供商，最后是各国的
So IANA, and then in Africa, in Europe, in Asia Pacific, in Latin America, and then we have resource allocation hierarchy, and then we have the service provider and then the national

3134
04:39:46,926 --> 04:39:48,976
IP注册机构。
IP registries in each country.

3135
04:39:49,070 --> 04:39:57,732
在每个国家，负责的洲际机构会将地址块分发给各国，然后这些国家再将地址块分发给ISP，
So in each country, the continent responsible ones are going to deliver blocks to the countries, and then the countries are going to deliver the blocks to the ISPs,

3136
04:39:58,176 --> 04:40:01,988
并且每一级都有记录来标注哪些已被使用，哪些尚未使用。
and each one has a record of what is used and what is not used.

3137
04:40:02,496 --> 04:40:04,964
这和车牌号的逻辑完全一样。
And that's exactly the analogy with plate numbers.

3138
04:40:05,296 --> 04:40:12,656
当你进入一个国家并获得车牌时，车牌上可能有城市名称或城市代码，然后再是一个编号。
When you go into a country and you get a plate number, the plate number may have the city name or the city code and then a number.

3139
04:40:12,846 --> 04:40:16,868
电话系统也是一样的。你有国家代码、区号和一个唯一的号码。
The phone system, same thing. You have the country code, area code, and a unique number.

3140
04:40:17,216 --> 04:40:19,300
互联网上的情况也完全一样。
The exact same thing happens on the internet.

3141
04:40:20,974 --> 04:40:25,572
IANA是互联网号码分配机构，是最高级别的机构，位于美国。
So IANA is the internet assigned numbers authority, the top-level body, and that's in the US.

3142
04:40:26,062 --> 04:40:32,896
然后是区域互联网注册机构，它们负责管理世界的不同部分。
And then you have the regional internet registries, which will manage the different parts of the

3143
04:40:32,896 --> 04:40:41,905
这些包括：北美的ARIN，欧洲和中东的RIPE，亚太地区的APNIC，拉丁美洲的LACNIC，以及非洲的AFRINIC。
world. And these are ARIN, North America, RIPE for Europe and Middle East, APNIC for Asia Pacific, LACNIC for Latin America, and AFRINIC

3144
04:40:42,256 --> 04:40:42,852
在非洲。
in Africa.

3145
04:40:43,374 --> 04:40:48,868
然后是每个国家内部的国家互联网注册机构，最后是互联网服务提供商。
And then we have the national internet registries inside each country, and then the internet service provider.

3146
04:40:49,102 --> 04:40:51,056
通过这部分讲解，你学到了什么？
What do you get out of all of this lecture?

3147
04:40:51,216 --> 04:40:53,316
核心信息是：要连接到互联网，
The message is to be on the internet,

3148
04:40:54,158 --> 04:41:00,096
无论是你自己在街上用手机，还是你所在的地点，都必须连接到互联网。
either you yourself, if you're using your phone in the street or the place where you are must be connected to the internet.

3149
04:41:00,398 --> 04:41:10,816
要连接到互联网，意味着你有经过注册并合法分配给你的公网IP地址，你有权使用它们，而且这些地址是唯一的，
To be connected to the internet, that means you have public IP addresses that are registered and they are assigned to you legally, and you are authorized to use them, and these are unique,

3150
04:41:11,376 --> 04:41:13,636
它们在地球上的任何其他地方都不会重复出现。
they will not exist anywhere else on the globe.

3151
04:41:16,622 --> 04:41:21,732
既然我们已经讨论过什么是公网IP地址，那么什么是私有IP地址呢？
What are the private IP addresses if we have already discussed what are the public IP addresses?

3152
04:41:22,478 --> 04:41:31,620
私有IP地址范围是指你可以直接使用、而不需要向任何人申请分配或授权的IP地址。
Private IP address ranges are IP addresses that you can use without having to go and ask for assignment or authorization from anyone.

3153
04:41:32,462 --> 04:41:36,484
这些被称为RFC 1918，即征求意见标准。
And these are called the RFC 1918, the request for comment.

3154
04:41:36,814 --> 04:41:42,704
存在私有IP地址范围，这些IP地址在互联网上是不可路由的。
There are private IP address ranges, and these IP addresses are not rootable on the internet.

3155
04:41:43,118 --> 04:41:49,572
所以你家里的无线路由器不能使用私有IP地址连接到ISP。
So you cannot have your wireless router at home be connected to the ISP using a private IP address.

3156
04:41:49,824 --> 04:41:50,564
这就是它的工作原理。
That's how it works.

3157
04:41:51,310 --> 04:41:52,708
或者说，这是常规做法。
Or that's how the norm is.

3158
04:41:53,454 --> 04:42:01,188
如果你的家用路由器或手机配置了私有IP地址并尝试连接互联网，是无法成功的。
