开发、编码、测试、部署和维护软件。
develop, code, test, deploy, and maintain software.

8636
12:23:09,166 --> 12:23:17,028
这将为我们提供一个逐步的流程或指南，以便能够管理整个生命周期
And this will provide us a step-by-step workflow or guide in order to be able to manage the entire life cycle

8637
12:23:17,488 --> 12:23:22,788
从规划一直到监控，并不断重复这个过程。
from the planning all the way to monitoring and iterating through this process again.

8638
12:23:23,982 --> 12:23:27,812
遵循这种逐步的工作流或流程
Benefits of following a workflow or a process step by step

8639
12:23:28,590 --> 12:23:34,532
或者说 软件开发生命周期，它能确保跨团队的软件创建有一个系统化的方法，
or SDLC, it will ensure that there is a systematic approach to the software creation across teams,

8640
12:23:35,182 --> 12:23:44,996
并提供一种衡量和改进开发过程的方法。我们可以查看工作流中的每一个阶段或每一步，看看它们是否按预期运行。
and it will provide a way to measure and improve the development process. We can look at every stage or every step in the workflow and find out if this is working as expected or not.

8641
12:23:45,838 --> 12:23:52,452
它能对不同步骤进行准确分析，找出哪些运行良好，哪些需要增强或改进。
And it allows an accurate analysis of the different steps, which one is working fine, which one needs enhancement or improvement.

8642
12:23:53,550 --> 12:23:56,068
而且根据我们采用的方法论，我们可以
And depending on the methodology we use, we can

