更频繁地进行测试、构建和测试，以便在流程早期发现错误或漏洞。
test more frequently and build and test more frequently to find errors or bugs early in the process.

8644
12:24:03,886 --> 12:24:12,928
当然，如果我们进行自动化，软件开发生命周期 也会促进更快的软件交付和更高的软件质量。
And of course, the SDLC also will facilitate, if we do the automation, it will facilitate faster software delivery and higher software quality, of course,

8645
