But let's find out how was software development done the old way.

8648
12:24:23,598 --> 12:24:32,100
在旧的方法中，我们有负责编码和构建的开发人员，然后他们把代码交给下一环节，
So the old way, we had the developers who are going to code and build, then they're going to ship the code over the fence,

8649
