他们进行测试，然后发给发布团队或发布经理团队，说：好了，我们完成了所有测试，反馈过来了，一切正常。
They will do their testing and then they will send it to the release team or the release manager team and say, okay, we have done all the tests, we did feedback, everything works fine.

8651
