每当一个团队完成工作，他们就会把它传给下一个，再到下一个，以此类推。所以团队之间没有协作，也没有整合。
When each one finishes their work, they will pass it on to the next one, to the next one, and so on. So there is no collaboration, there is no integration among the teams.

8656
