因此他们是独立的团队。当然，复杂的集成过程很麻烦，因为如果我们等所有代码在六个月或十二个月后才开始测试，
So they were discrete teams, complex integrations, of course, because if we are going to finish all the code six months, 12 months, and then start testing,

8657
