或者一天多次。这意味着我们必须更频繁地构建和测试，更频繁地让软件准备就绪，更频繁地进行部署。
or maybe multiple times a day, which means we have to build and test more frequently, and we have to get software ready. more frequently. we have to deploy more frequently.

8666
12:26:23,630 --> 12:26:31,204
这就是我们通过在稳定的、高性能的软件中添加功能来提升用户体验的方法。
and that's how we need to enhance the user experience by adding features in a stable software, highly performing all the time.

8667
