一个能够实现他们所需所有自动化的平台？它可以创建 GitHub 仓库，可以构建流水线，可以在云端部署基础设施，它将包含所有
the platform that can do all the automation they need? They can build repositories in GitHub, it can build pipelines, it can do infrastructure in the cloud, it will have all

