12:54:04,174 --> 12:54:13,552
使用模板启动新服务，而那些去构建这个平台的人——也就是平台工程团队，将精通这些工具，
Launch new services using templates, and the ones who are going to build this platform, the platform engineering team, is going to be proficient about these tools,

8962
12:54:13,712 --> 12:54:16,580
包括安全要求、公司政策以及所有相关内容。
the security requirements, the company policy, and all that stuff.

