12:54:37,152 --> 12:54:46,180
高效地测试、部署和运行应用程序，而不需要等待人工 DevOps 工程师来为他们搭建东西，因为那可能会成为瓶颈。
test, deploy, and run applications efficiently without having to wait for a human DevOps engineer to build stuff for them, which might be a bottleneck.

8966
12:54:47,630 --> 12:54:50,372
平台工程涉及设置云基础设施。
Platform engineering involves setting up cloud infrastructure.

8967
12:54:50,542 --> 12:54:54,180
也就是说，所有以前由 DevOps 工程师完成的工作。
