12:55:58,990 --> 12:56:01,348
并且包含内置的监控、日志记录和告警钩子。
With built-in monitoring, logging, and alerting hooks.

8981
12:56:02,542 --> 12:56:06,564
这样会让开发人员觉得部署变得非常简单。
And this will make the deployment feel easy to the developers.

