DevOps 团队将负责设置 Argo CD（这是 GitOps 所必需的）、Helm 图表以及 CI/CD 流水线。
The DevOps team will set up Argo CD, which is required for GitOps, Helm charts, and CI CD pipelines.

8983
12:56:14,158 --> 12:56:19,536
我经常被问到一个问题：平台工程会取代 DevOps 吗？
A common question I get about this one is would platform engineering kill DevOps?

8984
12:56:19,776 --> 12:56:20,868
答案是不会。
And the answer is no.

