12:56:21,136 --> 12:56:30,276
即使是平台工程师，他们也需要去干活。平台工程师必须熟悉所有这些服务，包括 CI/CD 以及如何配置各种工具等相关内容。
They need to do work even if they are part of the platform engineer. The platform engineer needs to know all these services, including CI CD and how to set up the tools and all that stuff.

8986
12:56:30,670 --> 12:56:36,896
因此，平台工程团队内部会有 DevOps 工程师，因为他们需要精通各种不同的 DevOps
So the platform engineering team will have DevOps engineers within because they need to be proficient in the different DevOps

8987
12:56:36,976 --> 12:56:42,436
工具。所以这可能是将岗位从 DevOps 工程师转到平台工程团队中。
tools. So it could be shifting the jobs from a DevOps engineer into platform engineering team.

8988
12:56:43,342 --> 12:56:51,684
或者也可以说是为了按照最佳实践正确配置 DevOps 工具，在平台工程团队里配备 DevOps 工程师。
Or it could be that I'm going to have DevOps engineers within the platform engineering team to set up the DevOps tools properly according to best practices.

8989
12:56:52,238 --> 12:57:02,532
也许开发团队也会有一名 DevOps 工程师，他们精通如何使用 IDP（内部开发平台），并负责相关工作。
And maybe the development team are going to have a DevOps engineer that will be proficient in how to use the IDP, the internal development platform, and the DevOps engineer will be working on that.

8990
12:57:02,736 --> 12:57:10,596
所以简短的回答是：平台工程不会取代 DevOps，它需要 DevOps 工程师的技能。
So the short answer is platform engineer is not going to kill DevOps, it requires the skills of DevOps engineers.

8991
12:57:12,782 --> 12:57:16,896
这就是平台工程师的工作内容，而这是 DevOps 工程要做的事情。
So this is what the platform engineer does, and this is what the DevOps engineering will do.

8992
12:57:16,976 --> 12:57:24,996
而 站点可靠性工程 将负责监控、可用时间、SLI、服务水平目标，以及值班处理、容量规划等等。
And SRE will be handling the monitoring, the uptime, the SLIs, the SLOs, and being on call and handle capacity planning and so on.

8993
12:57:28,206 --> 12:57:38,500
既然你可能会进入安全领域，而且我们讨论了 DevOps，那么研究如何保障流水线安全就非常有意义了。
Since you might end up being into security and we discussed DevOps, then it makes a lot of sense to look at how we can secure your pipelines.

8994
12:57:38,862 --> 12:57:43,236
我们要研究如何从开发人员编写代码的初始阶段开始就确保安全，
How we can secure it from the inception of the code by the developers

8995
12:57:43,886 --> 12:57:50,948
一直到部署完成，并确保谁有权限去处理这些应用程序。
all the way until it is deployed and ensuring who has the access and authorization to deal with these applications.

8996
12:57:52,110 --> 12:57:54,628
DevSecOps 就是负责所有这些工作的。
DevSecOps is what looks after all of this.

8997
12:57:54,862 --> 12:58:04,900
那么让我们来看看它到底是什么。有很多志在成为云安全工程师的人感兴趣，而其中一部分就是 DevSecOps。
So let's find out what that is. And there is a lot of people that are interested in building cloud as cloud security engineers, and part of that is going to be DevSecOps.

8998
12:58:05,806 --> 12:58:09,860
DevSecOps 代表开发（Development）加上安全（Security）再加上运维（Operations）。
So DevSecOps stands for development plus security plus operations.

8999
12:58:10,094 --> 12:58:14,180
也就是说，我们在 dev 和 ops 的基础上加入了 sec。
So we have dev and ops, and then we have sick on top of that.

9000
12:58:15,758 --> 12:58:22,692
这意味着将安全实践和工具整合到 DevOps 流水线的每一个阶段中。
So it means integrating security practices and tools into every stage of the DevOps pipeline.

9001
12:58:23,214 --> 12:58:27,172
从规划和编码，一直到部署和生产环境监控。
From planning and coding all the way to deployment and production monitoring.

9002
12:58:27,406 --> 12:58:35,172
简而言之，DevSecOps 是对 DevOps 流水线、自动化脚本以及你在 DevOps 中使用的所有内容的安全性保障。
So in short, DevSecOps is security of the DevOps pipeline and the automation scripts and everything you use in DevOps.

9003
12:58:35,950 --> 12:58:44,896
如果我们看看不同的阶段以及 DevOps 在每个阶段中的作用，当你进行 DevOps 规划时，
If we look at the different phases and how DevOps is going to act in each one of these, when you are doing the planning for DevOps,

9004
12:58:45,166 --> 12:58:49,284
你必须在设计讨论中包含安全要求和威胁建模。
you have to include security requirements and threat modeling in design discussions.

9005
12:58:50,126 --> 12:58:57,540
在编码时，我们需要使用静态代码分析工具（SAST）来尽早发现漏洞。
When coding, we need to use static code analysis tools, the SAST, to catch vulnerabilities very early.

9006
12:58:58,638 --> 12:59:08,944
而在构建阶段（即在测试前构建应用、整合工具和软件时），我们需要扫描依赖项中已知的常见漏洞和漏洞利用情况
And when you are building before testing, building the application, integrating the tool, the software together, then we need to scan dependencies for known common vulnerabilities and exploits

9007
12:59:09,166 --> 12:59:11,428
或者使用像 Snyk 之类的工具来检测漏洞，
or vulnerabilities using tools like SNCC,

9008
12:59:12,174 --> 12:59:14,596
还有 Trivy 和 Dependabot。
Trivi, and Dependabot.

9009
12:59:15,630 --> 12:59:23,716
当然，在 CI/CD 中，我们需要在流水线中自动化安全测试，包括代码中的密钥扫描、策略检查等等。
And for CI CD, of course, we need to automate security tests in pipelines for secret scanning, policy checks, and so on in the code.

9010
12:59:24,144 --> 12:59:24,996
简而言之，
The short

9011
12:59:25,710 --> 12:59:33,796
或者说总结一下就是：你必须在每一个步骤中考虑安全，从编码前的规划，到编码过程，
or the summary of this is: you have to think security in every step, from the planning before the coding, through the coding,

9012
12:59:34,222 --> 12:59:35,344
再到构建期间；
and during building;

9013
12:59:35,504 --> 12:59:45,104
以及在你进行 CI/CD 测试时，所有这些都应该包含扫描工具，以确保你的代码中没有后门
and when you are doing CI CD testing as well, that should all include security tools to scan to ensure that you don't have backdoors in your code

9014
12:59:45,184 --> 12:59:47,684
并且没有任何漏洞等等。
and you don't have any vulnerabilities in your code and so on.

9015
12:59:48,384 --> 12:59:49,264
此外，
Moreover,

9016
12:59:49,966 --> 12:59:55,024
当你考虑容器时，你必须扫描容器镜像中的漏洞。
when you are thinking about containers, you have to scan container images for vulnerabilities.

9017
12:59:55,184 --> 12:59:57,220
你需要确保它们是干净的。
You need to make sure that they are clean as well.

9018
12:59:58,030 --> 13:00:09,104
当你处理“基础设施即代码”脚本时，你可以使用 Checkov 和 Terraform Sentinel 等工具来确保基础设施定义的安全性，并确保你的代码中没有凭据
When you're working on scripts infrastructure as code, you can use tools like Chick-OV and Terraform Sentinel to ensure secure infrastructure definitions and you don't have credentials,

9019
13:00:09,184 --> 13:00:10,340
例如，在你的代码里。
for example, in your code.

9020
13:00:10,990 --> 13:00:17,188
对于密钥管理，比如密码、许可证、密钥之类的东西。
For the secrets management, passwords and so on, licenses, keys, and stuff like that.

9021
13:00:17,550 --> 13:00:28,484
你需要在 AWS 中使用 HashiCorp Vault Secrets Manager 或 sealed secrets 工具，这样你就可以在不将这些凭据嵌入到代码中的情况下进行存储。
You need to use HashiCorp Vault Secrets Manager in AWS or sealed secrets tools where you can store these credentials without having to embed them in your code.

9022
13:00:30,318 --> 13:00:36,228
而在生产监控方面，我们当然需要寻找安全事件、配置错误或漂移。
And for production monitoring, of course, we need to look for security events and misconfiguration or drifts.

9023
13:00:36,750 --> 13:00:42,084
有一些工具可以帮助你完成这些工作，比如 Falco、Sysdig 和 AWS GuardDuty 等。
And there are tools to help you do that, like Falco, OSEC, and AWS Guard Duty, etc.

9024
13:00:42,606 --> 13:00:50,276
所以，再次强调，在你的 DevOps 中，每一个动作、每一个步骤、每一项技术、每一段代码、每一个镜像都要考虑安全。
So, again, the message is think security in every action and every step and every technology, every code, every image you are using in your DevOps.

9025
13:00:53,806 --> 13:00:56,452
恭喜你完成这门课程。
Congratulations on finishing up the course.

9026
13:00:56,624 --> 13:01:05,184
希望内容有趣，并且你已经亲自完成了所有的实操演示实验和练习案例，以此来巩固
Hopefully, it was interesting and you have done all the hands-on demo labs and all the practice examples and all that yourself in order to cement

9027
13:01:05,344 --> 13:01:05,796
这些知识。
the knowledge.

9028
13:01:06,478 --> 13:01:14,464
再次提醒，如果你想获取更多知识、更深入的内容，想要更多的设计任务、更多的练习、更多的实操
Again, if you would like to get more knowledge and more depth into this course, you want to get more design assignments, more practice, more hands-on

9029
13:01:14,624 --> 13:01:27,664
实验，以及 IT 工具入门课程，它将为你提供宏观视角：什么是 Linux？什么是 Git？什么是 GitHub？什么是 Docker？什么是 Kubernetes？什么是 Bash 脚本和 Terraform？
